cPanel scores CVE-2026-29202 and CVE-2026-29203 at 5.3 under CVSS 4.0 and CVE-2026-29201 at 8.6, while The Hacker News reports 8.8, 8.8 and 4.3; only CVE-2026-29202 is code execution, CVE-2026-29203 is a symlink chmod flaw and CVE-2026-29201 an arbitrary file read. Every supported branch from 11.86 to 11.136 and WP Squared is patched as of 2026-05-08, and no source describes chaining the flaws with the earlier CVE-2026-41940 bypass, which Shadowserver tied to at least 44,000 likely compromised IP addresses on one day rather than to 44,000 hosts over two months.
